  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A browser concordancer where a researcher moves from keyword (keyness) and frequency lists to concordance lines, clusters, collocates and a dispersion plot for a search term, then down to the full source text with the match highlighted. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
